{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdealTowerTest","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdealTowerTest","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.FureyMinimalLeftIdeal","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Basis.Bilinear"],"declarations":64,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.no_sqrt_neg_one_of_ordered","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.no_sqrt_neg_one_of_ordered","kind":"theorem","line":692,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L692-L701","doc":"**The tower's chirality selector cannot see the root `i`.** The left line is selected\nby `|eigenvalue| > 1` (`LeftLineDefinition`), which needs an ORDERED field, and an ordered\nfield has no square root of `−1`. So tower data lives over an ordered subfield, is fixed by\n`i ↦ −i`, while `G` changes sign (`G_neg_root`): no tower structure breaks the swap. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.flavour_obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.flavour_obstruction","kind":"theorem","line":674,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L674-L690","doc":"**Flavour obstruction.** No chirality-blind (`G`-commuting) operator carries the `S_u`\nvacuum onto a nonzero multiple of the `S_d` vacuum: Furey's `S_u ↔ S_d` exchange is `G`-odd,\nwhereas the tower flavour flip `σ ↔ σ⁻¹` fixes both eigenlines (is `J`-even). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.forced_chirality_embedding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.forced_chirality_embedding","kind":"theorem","line":638,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L638-L672","doc":"**Forced chirality embedding — unique up to a scalar per line.** If such an `f` also\nintertwines a tower grading `J` with `G`, the `J = +1` line goes into `K·ν` and the `J = −1`\nline into `K·e⁺`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.colourBlind_lands_in_singlets","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.colourBlind_lands_in_singlets","kind":"theorem","line":630,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L630-L636","doc":"**Colour-blind data can only land in the lepton singlets.** Any `K`-linear map from a\nmodule with trivial `su(3)` action that is `su(3)`-equivariant takes values in\n`span(ν, e⁺)`, i.e. has zero quark-level (1, 2) components. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_vacD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_vacD","kind":"theorem","line":626,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L626-L628","doc":"The `S_d` vacuum `Ω' = vac(−i)` is `G`-ODD, while the `S_u` vacuum is `G`-even. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_smul","kind":"theorem","line":623,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L623-L624","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_neg_root","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_neg_root","kind":"theorem","line":620,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L620-L621","doc":"The opposite root negates the grading (Galois). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_fock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_fock","kind":"theorem","line":613,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L613-L618","doc":"**`G = (−1)^N`** on Furey's eight states. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G_sq","kind":"theorem","line":610,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L610-L611","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.G","kind":"def","line":607,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L607-L608","doc":"The canonical `ℤ/2`-grading of `S_u ≅ 𝕆_K`: `G = i · L(e₁)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level2_irreducible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level2_irreducible","kind":"theorem","line":586,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L586-L602","doc":"**The triplet `3̄` (level 2) is irreducible**, likewise, for `uʳ, uᵍ, uᵇ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level1_irreducible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level1_irreducible","kind":"theorem","line":567,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L567-L584","doc":"**The triplet `3` (level 1) is irreducible**: every `su(3)`-stable subspace containing a\nnonzero vector of level 1 contains all of `d̄ʳ, d̄ᵍ, d̄ᵇ`, hence (`level1_decomp`) the whole\nlevel. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Su3Stable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Su3Stable","kind":"def","line":563,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L563-L565","doc":"An `su(3)`-stable subspace, as a hypothesis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level2_decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level2_decomp","kind":"theorem","line":550,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L550-L561","doc":"**Level 2 is spanned by `uʳ, uᵍ, uᵇ`** (Fock vectors 4–6). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level1_decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.level1_decomp","kind":"theorem","line":537,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L537-L548","doc":"**Level 1 is spanned by `d̄ʳ, d̄ᵍ, d̄ᵇ`** (Fock vectors 1–3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.sq_smul_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.sq_smul_self","kind":"theorem","line":531,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L531-L535","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer_fock_action","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer_fock_action","kind":"theorem","line":502,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L502-L529","doc":"The action of the five chosen colour derivations on the six quark Fock vectors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer11_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer11_mem","kind":"theorem","line":498,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L498-L500","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer10_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer10_mem","kind":"theorem","line":494,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L494-L496","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer7_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer7_mem","kind":"theorem","line":490,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L490-L492","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.triplet_core","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.triplet_core","kind":"theorem","line":454,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L454-L488","doc":"**Abstract weight argument.** Let `W` be stable under `H₁ H₂ E F`, where the `Hⱼ` square to\n`−1` or vanish on the lines `u₁ u₂ u₃` as stated and `E`, `F` connect `u₁ ↔ u₂ ↔ u₃`. Then any\nnonzero `a u₁ + b u₂ + c u₃ ∈ W` forces `u₁, u₂, u₃ ∈ W`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.su3_invariant_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.su3_invariant_iff","kind":"theorem","line":419,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L419-L443","doc":"**The `su(3)`-invariant vectors are exactly `span(e₀, e₁)` = `span(ν, e⁺)`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_octDer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_octDer","kind":"theorem","line":413,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L413-L417","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer9_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer9_mem","kind":"theorem","line":409,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L409-L411","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer6_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.octDer6_mem","kind":"theorem","line":405,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L405-L407","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_su3_mem_levelSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_su3_mem_levelSpace","kind":"theorem","line":394,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L394-L401","doc":"**`su(3)` preserves each level space** (levels 1 and 2 are `levelSpace i`,\n`levelSpace (−i)`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_su3_imag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_su3_imag","kind":"theorem","line":372,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L372-L392","doc":"On a vector with `x₀ = x₁ = 0`, the base-changed colour derivation keeps `x₀ = x₁ = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_mem_level2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_mem_level2","kind":"theorem","line":365,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L365-L370","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_mem_level1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_mem_level1","kind":"theorem","line":358,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L358-L363","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.levelSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.levelSpace","kind":"def","line":355,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L355-L356","doc":"The level subspaces of the imaginary part: `L(e₁) = s` on `Im 𝕆 ∩ span(e₂..e₇)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.toMatrix'_entry","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.toMatrix'_entry","kind":"theorem","line":345,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L345-L353","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.der_comp1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.der_comp1","kind":"theorem","line":325,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L325-L343","doc":"A derivation fixing `e₁` has no `e₁`-component on `e_m`, `m ≥ 2` (ℚ-side). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.der_comp0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.der_comp0","kind":"theorem","line":309,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L309-L323","doc":"A derivation has no `e₀`-component on an imaginary unit (ℚ-side). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_su3_kills_fock7","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_su3_kills_fock7","kind":"theorem","line":304,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L304-L307","doc":"**Singlets**: `su(3)` kills `e⁺` (level 3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_su3_kills_fock0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_su3_kills_fock0","kind":"theorem","line":299,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L299-L302","doc":"**Singlets**: `su(3)` kills `ν = Ω` (level 0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock7_decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock7_decomp","kind":"theorem","line":296,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L296-L297","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vac_decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vac_decomp","kind":"theorem","line":293,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L293-L294","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_comm_Le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_comm_Le","kind":"theorem","line":286,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L286-L291","doc":"**The colour algebra commutes with the `e₁`-complex structure** on `𝕆_K`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_eOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_eOne","kind":"theorem","line":283,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L283-L284","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_one","kind":"theorem","line":279,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L279-L281","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.map_stdIm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.map_stdIm","kind":"theorem","line":275,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L275-L277","doc":"`stdIm` base-changes to `eOne`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_leibniz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_leibniz","kind":"theorem","line":257,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L257-L273","doc":"**Base change preserves the Leibniz rule.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omulₗ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.omulₗ","kind":"def","line":252,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L252-L255","doc":"The octonion product as a `K`-bilinear map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.map_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.map_single","kind":"theorem","line":248,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L248-L250","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD_map","kind":"theorem","line":242,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L242-L246","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.extD","kind":"def","line":238,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L238-L240","doc":"Base change of a ℚ-linear endomorphism of `𝕆_ℚ` to `𝕆_K`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_linearIndependent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.fock_linearIndependent","kind":"theorem","line":204,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/li