aration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.mem_Su_apply","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L156-L161","doc":"Every element of `S_u` is determined by its value on the vacuum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vacProj_mem_Su","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vacProj_mem_Su","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L154-L154","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Su_left_ideal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Su_left_ideal","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L148-L152","doc":"`S_u` is a left ideal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.mem_Su","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.mem_Su","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L146-L146","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Su","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.Su","kind":"def","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L137-L144","doc":"**Furey's minimal left ideal** `S_u = End_K(𝕆_K)·ωω†`, as `{X : X ∘ ωω† = X}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vacProj_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.vacProj_idem","kind":"th