 vacuum functional `φ(x) = (x₀ − i x₁)/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.lmul_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.lmul_apply","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L102-L102","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.lmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FureyIdeal.lmul","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FureyIdealTowerTest.lean#L96-L100","doc":"Left multiplication as a `K`-linear map. ","signatureChunk":0}]}